 zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-font-14&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Candidate_List&quot;&gt;Candidates&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-font-14&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Candidate_Pool&quot;&gt;Pool&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;rh-tool-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-gap-10&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;zc-li-outline business-briefcase-24 zcs-font-22 zcs-color-theme&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;zcs-font-18 zcs-font-semibold zcs-m-0&quot;&gt;Applications and conversion&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p class=&quot;zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary zcs-m-0&quot;&gt;Use active applications for lifecycle actions, feedback links, pool moves, hold/resume, and conversion to employee.&lt;/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-font-14&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Active_Job_Applications&quot;&gt;Active Applications&lt;/a&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;rh-tool-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-gap-10&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;zc-li-outline ui-1-edit-72 zcs-font-22 zcs-color-theme&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;zcs-font-18 zcs-font-semibold zcs-m-0&quot;&gt;Feedback and evidence&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p class=&quot;zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary zcs-m-0&quot;&gt;Review feedback recommendations, interview-round rows, and offer-document rows from one workspace.&lt;/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-flex zcs-gap-10 zcs-row&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-font-14&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Interview_Feedback_List&quot;&gt;Feedback&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-font-14&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Application_Offer_Document_List&quot;&gt;Offer Docs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;rh-panel rh-panel-requests&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;rh-embed-card&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rh-embed-header zcs-px-20 zcs-py-12&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;zcs-font-18 zcs-font-semibold zcs-m-0&quot;&gt;Job Request List&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-font-13 zcs-color-secondary&quot;&gt;All hiring requests and HR request tracking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rh-report-frame tall&quot; zc-component=&quot;report&quot; zc-linkname=&quot;Job_Request_List&quot; zc-height=&quot;700px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;rh-embed-card&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rh-embed-header zcs-px-20 zcs-py-12&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;zcs-font-18 zcs-font-semibold zcs-m-0&quot;&gt;Pending CEO Job Requests&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-font-13 zcs-color-secondary&quot;&gt;CEO queue with Approval_Remarks actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rh-report-frame&quot; zc-component=&quot;report&quot; zc-linkname=&quot;Pending_CEO_Job_Requests&quot; zc-height=&quot;620px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;rh-panel rh-panel-candidates&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;rh-embed-card&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rh-embed-header zcs-px-20 zcs-py-12&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;zcs-font-18 zcs-font-semi